{"product_id":"fly-guy","title":"Fly Guy","description":"\u003cp\u003eNature lover Sarah Dundee just landed her dream job: researching stories all across the country for an environmental magazine. Her goal: fly there. In her own plane. Everything's under control--until flight instructor Logan Donnelly shows up to give her a refresher course in aggravation--he's the guy who plans to build a new airfield runway through a woodland habitat! Logan better forget any romantic notions he may have about Sarah, even if he is...well, sexy. And handsome. And hot. Sarah's determined to prevent his airfield from ever being built. Logan can't argue. Sarah Dundee is quite a woman, in every way that counts. If she wants to learn to fly, he'd be happy to teach her everything he knows. Everything. \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Laura Bradford \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9780821780329 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: Mass Market Paperback \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 352\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44975787442329,"sku":"13RE9780821780329","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/d269077f8c5d64410980d628a7733ec5.jpg?v=1732294612","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/fly-guy","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}